 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Launch sideways",
   "text": "A ball leaves the edge of a cliff of height \\( H \\) with a **horizontal** velocity \\( v_x \\). Initially there is no vertical velocity.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 0,
      "ph": 0,
      "vx": 10,
      "H": 20
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "A parabola",
   "text": "The ball moves along the right branch of a parabola: constant speed sideways, free fall downward.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 1,
      "vx": 10,
      "H": 20
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "ph": 1
     },
     "at": 0,
     "dur": 5500
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Components in flight",
   "text": "At each point the **teal** arrow \\( v_x \\) never changes, while the **pink** arrow \\( v_y = g t \\) keeps growing. The **blue** resultant \\( v = \\sqrt{v_x^2 + v_y^2} \\) tilts steeper.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 2,
      "ph": 0.6,
      "vx": 10,
      "H": 20
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "title": "Time and range",
   "text": "The fall alone fixes the time: \\( H = \\tfrac12 g T^2 \\Rightarrow T = \\sqrt{2H/g} = {{T|2}} \\) s. Then \\( R = v_x T = {{R|1}} \\) m.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 3,
      "ph": 1,
      "vx": 10,
      "H": 20
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "title": "A higher cliff",
   "text": "Raise \\( H \\) to 40 m: the fall takes longer, so the same \\( v_x \\) carries the ball farther.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 3,
      "ph": 0,
